Hey folks, found offending commit https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/666bcb20565af8e7f868e835cc039a7b7ffb434b
and i was able to come up with MVP. Is there any other way I can help?

@matheusmdx @clayjohn @akien-mga

From what I'm able to understand inline_data here becomes true and places where apply_mask_layer is invoked get replaced with copy of this method's body. if i set inline_data to false explictly it works in mvp. it adds too many code branches and qualcomm doesn't like it for some reason

```
const bool inline_data = store_respv || !RESPV_ONLY_INLINE_SHADERS_WITH_SPEC_CONSTANTS;
respv::Shader respv_shader(decoded_spirv.ptr(), decoded_spirv.size(), inline_data);
```
